program	conformance/M26_varself_on_let_implicitcopy.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	cannot call `&var self` method `rename` on immutable variable `t`
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: cannot call `&var self` method `rename` on immutable variable `t`"
log	"  --> examples/conformance/M26_varself_on_let_implicitcopy.saw:13:6"
log	"     |"
log	" 13 |     t.rename(\"b\")"
log	"     |      ^"
log	"   hint: consider using `var` instead of `let` to make it mutable"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
